      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "任务、执行、配置与写入策略的正式含义，以及只读预检的三权限交集和未装配 Runtime 的边界",
        "en": "Formal task, execution, configuration and apply policy semantics, including the read-only precheck permission intersection and pending Runtime integration"
      }
    },
