        "zh-cn": "Transfer Planner 对快照目标 apply_mode 仅接受 replace/append，拒绝其他组合；已复核 CSV/TSV 的 Meta 编码消费调整，写入模式约束不变",
        "en": "Transfer Planner admits only replace/append as snapshot target apply modes; reviewed CSV/TSV consumption of Meta encoding facts without changing apply mode constraints"
      }
    }
